## Anti Patterns

### 1. Monolithic Architecture in Cloud

```yaml
# Không nên - single large instance
ec2:
  instance_type: xlarge.32xlarge
  # Everything on one machine!
```

### 2. No Cost Controls

```yaml
# Không nên - unlimited resources
s3:
  versioning: true
  replication: all-buckets
  # No lifecycle policies!
```

### 3. Ignoring Security

```yaml
# Không nên - open security
security_group:
  ingress:
    - protocol: all
      source: 0.0.0.0/0
```

## Best Practices

### 1. Infrastructure as Code

```yaml
# All infrastructure defined as code
infrastructure:
  - terraform_modules/
  - cloudformation_templates/
  - ansible_playbooks/
```

### 2. Immutable Infrastructure

```yaml
# Deploy new instances, don't modify
immutable:
  golden_ami: true
  rolling_deployments: true
```

